, wireless connectivity, and radar products; and applications processors for specific computing activity. It also provides DLP products primarily for use in projecting high-definition images; calculators; and application-specific integrated circuits. Its products are used in various markets, such as industrial, automotive, personal electronics, communications equipment, enterprise systems, calculators, and others. The company markets and sells its semiconductor products through direct sales and distributors, as well as through its website. Texas Instruments Incorporated was founded in 1930 and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas.","employees":33000,"website":"https://www.ti.com","country":"United States","city":"Dallas","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Haviv  Ilan","title":"President, CEO & Chairman"},{"name":"Mr. Amichai  Ron","title":"Senior Vice President of Embedded Processing & DLP® Products"},{"name":"Ms. Julie C. Knecht","title":"Senior VP, CFO & Chief Accounting Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.08,"tpe":32.76,"ps":6.509,"pfcf":32.17,"peg":1.01,"pb":7.665,"rev_growth":0.2175,"eps_growth":0.464,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2596,"eps_growth_next":0.1955,"div_yield":0.0011,"roe":0.2326,"roa":0.07978,"de":48.45,"gross_margin":0.586,"op_margin":0.2256,"profit_margin":0.1916,"current_ratio":1.562},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":26.81,"sector":18.08,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":38.66,"sector":32.76,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":13.6,"sector":6.509,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":59.1,"sector":32.17,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.9,"sector":1.01,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":14.72,"sector":7.665,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":70.65,"sector":48.45,"verdict":"High debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.277,"sector":0.2175,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth","labe